{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>Behold.</b> The Gaon [Saadia] said: upon the palms of the clouds. In my opinion, the verse spoke in human terms — \"upon the palms your walls are engraved\" — that I may see you continually, and the witness is half a verse, as is the rule."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:58:44.758304331Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}